		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Long-haired faerie maid with a fox tail and a hole in her back, showing her interior to be a bark-lined cavity. Myths say trolls crafted the huldra, but the huldra scoff at this.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 14, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +2 (1d6) and 1 tail +3 (<strong>C</strong>HA drain) or 1 lucky touch, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>CHA Drain</strong>. Target takes 1d6 CHA damage, getting uglier with each tail blow.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lucky Touch</strong>. By touch, give or take away a luck token.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
